<!doctype html>
<html lang="pt-BR"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#123c35"><title>Pagamento via Pix | Juliana Damasceno</title><style>:root{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#163b35;background:#f2f5f2}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;padding:24px}.card{width:min(100%,460px);background:white;border-radius:22px;padding:34px 28px;box-shadow:0 16px 45px #173e3320;text-align:center}.eyebrow{font-size:12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;color:#40816d}.icon{width:58px;height:58px;border-radius:18px;background:#e5f4eb;display:grid;place-items:center;margin:0 auto 18px;font-size:30px}h1{font-size:26px;margin:12px 0}h2{font-size:18px;line-height:1.4;margin:12px 0 22px}.muted{color:#62756f;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55}.field{border:1px solid #d8e5de;background:#f7faf8;border-radius:12px;padding:16px;margin:24px 0 14px}.field small{display:block;color:#687e74;margin-bottom:8px}.key{font-size:22px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.4px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.btn{display:block;width:100%;border:0;border-radius:12px;background:#16834a;color:white;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;padding:17px;cursor:pointer}.btn:hover{background:#0f6c3c}.steps{text-align:left;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;color:#4b635a;margin-top:24px}footer{font-size:12px;color:#789087;margin-top:25px}</style></head><body><main class="card"><div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">◇</div><div class="eyebrow">PAGAMENTO VIA PIX</div><h1>Pagamento seguro e simples</h1><h2>Juliana Damasceno<br>Sociedade Individual de Advocacia</h2><p class="muted">Escolha o valor do pagamento no aplicativo do seu banco.</p><div class="field"><small>CHAVE PIX · CNPJ</small><div class="key" id="chave">27.805.716/0001-12</div></div><button class="btn" id="copiar" type="button">COPIAR CHAVE PIX</button><p class="muted">Instituição: Banco do Brasil<br>Salvador · Bahia</p><div class="steps"><strong>Como pagar:</strong><ol><li>Toque em “Copiar chave Pix”.</li><li>Abra o aplicativo do seu banco e escolha Pix.</li><li>Selecione pagar por chave, escolha CNPJ e cole a chave.</li><li>Informe o valor e confira os dados do recebedor antes de confirmar.</li></ol></div><footer>Esta página não solicita senhas ou dados bancários e não confirma pagamentos automaticamente.</footer></main><script>const chave='27805716000112';document.getElementById('copiar').addEventListener('click',async()=>{let ok=false;try{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(chave);ok=true}catch(e){const el=document.createElement('textarea');el.value=chave;document.body.appendChild(el);el.select();ok=document.execCommand('copy');el.remove()}const btn=document.getElementById('copiar');btn.textContent=ok?'CHAVE COPIADA!':'SELECIONE E COPIE A CHAVE ACIMA';if(!ok){const r=document.createRange();r.selectNodeContents(document.getElementById('chave'));getSelection().removeAllRanges();getSelection().addRange(r)}setTimeout(()=>btn.textContent='COPIAR CHAVE PIX',3500)});</script></body></html>
